  "sort": 400000,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When an attack roll hits you, you can take a Reaction to disperse into shadowy energy. Until the end of your next turn, you have Resistance to all damage (including the triggering attack's), you can't take any action, Bonus Action, or Reaction, and you have a Fly Speed of 40 feet. When the effect ends, you can spend up to half your total Hit Point Dice, regaining Hit Points as if you had finished a Short Rest. Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p>",
